From 7fd84e01a342b15dc467707909f5d4a48649a1a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:03:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - KPI rates; revive via a quiet healer; no grey
 grinding; follower-credit quests

- scorecard: quests/h, levels/h, deaths/h columns; --compare prints the three rates + MEAN
- revive: every reclaim spot inside aggro range (<30 yd) -> quiet spirit healer (only_safe)
- grind: never grey mobs (gray_level = AC GetGrayLevel); a guarded local target is skipped
  10 min and the bot looks elsewhere (Durotar's warlock ended on one)
- follow_credit: credit paid by SAI DISTANCE_CREATURE markers for a summoned follower
  (14021 Miner Troubles): lead it marker to marker in 20 yd hops, no detours, wait for it,
  kill what hits it, abandon + retake when it is gone

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
